[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SC-025
STATUS: Legacy status pending audit
TITLE: typed expression nodes now integrate with both compiler-bound entry points, but a stable serialization schema is not implemented. SC-031 is implemented for source-linked scalar counterexamples and automated CLR replay within this subset. SC-026/SC-032 are implemented for the documented subset and report outcomes. Custom types, checked exception paths, loops, heap state, generic math and method-level postconditions remain open. This increment does not close all of Issue #2.
STATEMENT: typed expression nodes now integrate with both compiler-bound entry points, but a stable serialization schema is not implemented. SC-031 is implemented for source-linked scalar counterexamples and automated CLR replay within this subset. SC-026/SC-032 are implemented for the documented subset and report outcomes. Custom types, checked exception paths, loops, heap state, generic math and method-level postconditions remain open. This increment does not close all of Issue #2..
